#HELPS
1 ADDADSHASHANAMMU DAEDRIC SHRINE~
Addadshashanammu is an island shrine to Sheogorath northwest of old Hlormaren,
where ruined temple courts overlook the sea under the gaze of prowling Daedra.
Hostile worshippers and a winged twilight guard potions, soul gems and scrolls
around a cursed pearl resting upon the desecrated altar.
~
